  "distanthorizons.config.title": "Distant Horizons设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client": "客户端",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering": "启用远景渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，Distant Horizons会在原版渲染距离之外渲染LOD远景。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress": "显示LOD生成/导入进度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress.@tooltip": "开启后，运行时会在屏幕上显示世界生成或导入进度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting": "画质预设",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting.@tooltip": "同时调整多项图形设置，快速更改Distant Horizons的渲染质量。\n\n如果GPU满载或帧率不佳，请降低此设置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting": "CPU负载",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting.@tooltip": "调整Distant Horizons使用的线程数量。\n\n提高此设置可加快远景生成和LOD加载，\n但也会增加CPU和内存占用，并可能引起卡顿。\n\n注意：此设置按CPU性能相对调整。\n对于2核和64核CPU，它应产生相近比例的负载。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton": "显示设置按钮",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton.@tooltip": "在视野按钮左侧显示DH设置按钮。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced": "高级选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "图形",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.server": "服务器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding": "LOD构建",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多线程",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.logging": "日志",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD渲染半径（区块）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons的渲染距离，以区块为单位。\n\n注意：这是尽力达到的目标值。\n根据其他图形设置，实际渲染距离可能高于或低于此值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD细节递减间距",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "控制LOD画质逐级降低的距离间隔。\n\n提高此设置会增大间隔，\n但也会增加内存和GPU占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平分辨率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD可渲染的最高细节程度。\n\n§6最快：§r区块\n§6最精细：§r方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "控制LOD对悬挑、洞穴、悬崖等结构的表现精度。\n\n提高此设置会增加内存和GPU占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "按相机位置计算细节递减",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "开启后，DH会尝试按相机位置计算LOD细节递减。\n关闭后，则使用玩家位置。\n\n开启有助于自由相机Mod正确渲染。\n关闭有助于多相机Mod正确渲染，例如Immersive Portals或相机Mod。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "缩放时提高画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "开启后，放大视野时会提高LOD画质，\n例如使用望远镜或缩放Mod时。\n\n只影响相机视野内的LOD。\n\n放大后，LOD会加载到靠近观察时应有的细节程度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "缩放画质最大提升级数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "缩放最多可提升多少级LOD细节。\n数值越大，强缩放下的地形越清晰，\n但缩放时也会增加内存和GPU占用。\n\n原版望远镜需要提升4级细节才能达到完整画质。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "控制LOD画质随距离降低的速度。\n\n数值越大，远处地形越精细，\n但也会增加内存和GPU占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明效果",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD明暗处理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "设置LOD的明暗处理方式。\n可用于改善光影兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草方块侧面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "设置草方块LOD的侧面和底面的渲染方式。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "淡出附近的DH LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "开启后，靠近LOD时会逐渐将其淡出。\n关闭后，LOD会在距相机一定距离处突然消失。\n此设置受原版重复绘制预防选项影响。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "原版区块淡出模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "设置原版Minecraft区块如何过渡到Distant Horizons LOD。\n\nNONE：最快，DH与原版渲染之间会有明显边界。\nSINGLE_PASS：在原版透明渲染阶段后淡出，水下不透明方块不会淡出。\nDOUBLE_PASS：最慢，在原版不透明和透明渲染阶段后分别淡出，过渡最平滑。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane": "在远裁剪平面前淡出",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane.@tooltip": "是否在到达远裁剪平面前淡出DH？\n可避免DH云层在远处突然被截断。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "控制LOD颜色的亮度。\n\n0 = 黑色\n1 = 正常\n2 = 接近白色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier": "饱和度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "控制LOD颜色的饱和度。\n\n0 = 黑白\n1 = 正常\n2 = 鲜艳",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生物群系混合",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "相当于应用于LOD区域的原版生物群系混合设置。\n\n注意：任何大于0的值都会延长LOD加载时间。\n\n0相当于原版的1x1，\n1相当于原版的3x3，\n2相当于原版的5x5，以此类推。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao": "启用环境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao.@tooltip": "环境光遮蔽可增加方块光照的层次感。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing": "启用抗锯齿",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing.@tooltip": "抗锯齿可平滑边缘，并减少移动时的闪烁。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering": "通用对象渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering": "启用通用对象渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，DH会渲染非地形对象，\n例如信标光束和云层。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering": "启用信标渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight": "信标渲染高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight.@tooltip": "设置信标可渲染到的最大高度。重新加载世界后生效。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "加宽远处信标光束",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "开启后，极远处的LOD信标光束会加宽，便于观察。\n关闭后，所有LOD信标光束始终只有1格宽。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，渲染LOD信标光束。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "启用云层渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，渲染LOD云层。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "启用云层的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "允许DH渲染云层的维度资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n修改后需要重新加载世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "启用多层云",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "关闭：DH像原版一样只渲染一层云。\n开启：DH在不同高度渲染三层云。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "启用DH雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "控制是否在DH LOD上绘制雾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "雾颜色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "设置LOD上雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "启用原版雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6开启：§rMinecraft正常渲染雾。\n§6关闭：§r禁用原版区块上的雾。\n\n可能与其他修改雾效的Mod冲突。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "高级雾效选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "远雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "设置远雾开始的位置。\n\n0.0：从玩家位置开始。\n1.0：起点圆内切于LOD渲染距离的正方形。\n1.414：起点圆外接于LOD渲染距离的正方形。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "远雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "设置远雾结束的位置。\n\n0.0：在玩家位置结束。\n1.0：终点圆内切于LOD渲染距离的正方形。\n1.414：终点圆外接于LOD渲染距离的正方形。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "远雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "设置雾的最小浓度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全呈现雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "远雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "设置雾的最大浓度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全呈现雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "远雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "设置雾浓度的计算方式。\n\nLINEAR：随距离线性变化（忽略密度）。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2))\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity": "远雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "设置远雾的密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "高度雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度雾混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "设置高度如何影响雾。\n不确定时可先尝试SPHERICAL、ADDITION或MAX。\n\nSPHERICAL：按到相机的距离计算雾。\nCYLINDRICAL：忽略高度，只按水平距离计算。\nMAX：max(heightFog, farFog)\nADDITION：heightFog + farFog\nMULTIPLY：heightFog * farFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY：1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nLIMITED_ADDITION：farFog + max(farFog, heightFog)\nMULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + farFog * heightFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nAVERAGE：farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "高度雾方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "设置高度雾分布的位置。\n\nABOVE_CAMERA：从相机向天空延伸。\nBELOW_CAMERA：从相机向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：从相机向天空和虚空延伸。\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空延伸。\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空和虚空延伸。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度雾基准高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "按指定高度计算高度雾时，使用的基准高度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "设置高度雾起点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：无偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界高度（包含深度）。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "设置高度雾终点的偏移量。\n\n0.0：无偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界高度（包含深度）。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "高度雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "设置雾的最小浓度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全呈现雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "高度雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "设置雾的最大浓度。\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全呈现雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "设置高度雾浓度的计算方式。\n\nLINEAR：随高度线性变化（忽略密度）。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(height*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((height*density)^2))\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "设置高度雾的密度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "启用LOD纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "开启后，附近及放大观察时的LOD会使用方块实际的纹理和轮廓，\n而不是单一的纯色。\n\n仅作用于纹理实际可见的高细节LOD，远处LOD始终使用纯色。\n启用光影包时无效，因为光影包会使用自己的程序渲染LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "纹理细节等级上限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "允许使用方块纹理渲染的最大细节等级编号。\n等级编号越大，每个LOD覆盖的方块越多，\n纹理可能小于一个像素而无法看见。\n\n提高此值会为更远的LOD添加纹理，但增加内存占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不渲染纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "不使用纹理渲染的方块资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n支持部分匹配或不完整的资源标识符。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "侧面改用底面纹理的方块资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n支持部分匹配或不完整的资源标识符。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块标签",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "侧面改用底面纹理的方块标签列表，以逗号分隔。\n\n例如：\"grass_blocks,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "始终光栅化纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "使用光栅化确定各面纹理的方块资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n\n可用于修复某些Mod或方块的侧面只使用模型纹理一部分时的问题。\n\n例如：\"minecraft:beacon\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "启用噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "开启后，在LOD上应用噪声纹理以模拟纹理细节。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "噪声空间细分程度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "控制LOD噪声纹理的空间细分程度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "噪声强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "噪声淡出距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理淡出前的渲染距离，以方块为单位。\n设为0可禁用噪声淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "重复绘制预防",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "设置Distant Horizons从距相机多远处开始渲染，\n按原版渲染距离的比例计算。\n-1 = 自动，随原版渲染距离调整。\n\n提高此值会在更远的范围内阻止LOD绘制在原版方块后面，\n但可能导致LOD出现空洞。\n飞越尚未加载的地形时最容易出现空洞。\n\n提高原版渲染距离可增强此设置的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "快速移动时减少重复绘制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "开启后，快速飞行或移动时，重复绘制预防半径会向相机收缩。\n\n有助于减少Minecraft区块加载或生成速度跟不上DH时的问题。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "启用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "开启后，剔除洞穴。\n\n补充说明：当前会在没有顶部封闭层的维度中，\n剔除洞穴剔除高度以下、天空光照值为0的所有面。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "设置开始洞穴剔除的Y坐标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "启用信标距离剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "开启后，不绘制靠近相机的信标，以避免与原版重复绘制。\n关闭后，渲染所有信标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "禁用视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "关闭后，不绘制相机视野之外的LOD，从而提高GPU性能。\n\n开启后，绘制所有LOD，包括相机后方的LOD，会降低GPU性能。\n\n如果视野边缘的LOD错误消失，可尝试启用本选项，以禁用视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "禁用阴影阶段视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "与另一项视锥剔除设置相同，\n但仅在使用DH API的光影Mod进行阴影渲染时生效。\n\n如果阴影渲染异常，可尝试启用本选项，以禁用阴影阶段的视锥剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略渲染的方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "DH不渲染的方块资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在列表中。\n\n注意：如果出现缝隙或空洞，可能需要将worldCompression\n改为 [MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS]，然后重新生成LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "忽略渲染的洞穴方块列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "在地下天空光照为0的区域不渲染的方块资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在列表中。\n\n默认为空，因为大部分洞穴方块已因透明、非实心或液体属性而自动忽略。\n需要时可在此添加更多方块。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水下表面方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "以逗号分隔的方块资源标识符列表。\n这些方块在水面可见时会被替换为水。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "以逗号分隔的方块资源标识符列表。\n这些方块位于水面上方时会被移除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "忽略的方块类型",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "设置哪些方块参与LOD渲染。\n\n§6NONE：§r包含所有方块。\n§6NON_COLLIDING：§r只渲染实体方块（忽略高草、火把等）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "使用被忽略方块的颜色染色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：会让雪、地毯和活板门看起来很糟糕§r\n是否让被忽略方块下方的方块使用其颜色？\n§6开启：§r草地上的红花会将下方草地染红。\n§6关闭：§r被忽略的方块不改变下方表面的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "覆盖原版图形设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "开启后，DH初始化时会自动调整部分原版图形设置以改善体验。\n\n例如禁用会覆盖DH LOD的原版云，\n以及原版区块淡入淡出（DH已负责原版区块的过渡）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental": "实验性选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "1相当于现实地球的曲率。\n允许的最小值为50，最大值为5000。\n1到49之间的值会向上调整为50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略的维度列表（CSV）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "不渲染DH的维度资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n例如：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\"\n\nMinecraft 1.12.2及更早版本：\n打开F3界面，复制黄色显示的dimension_name:ID，例如 \"overworld:0\"。\n\n注意：禁用DH渲染时，部分DH设置会被禁用或调整，以改善画面。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater": "自动更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableAutoUpdater": "启用自动更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates": "启用静默更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates.@tooltip": "有新版本可用时自动更新Mod。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch": "更新渠道",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch.@tooltip": "设置最新版本的下载来源。\n\n自动：根据当前JAR选择稳定版或每日构建版。\n稳定版：从Modrinth下载稳定构建。\n每日构建版：从GitLab下载每日构建。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人游戏",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "服务器文件夹命名方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "设置多人游戏本地数据的文件夹命名格式。\n\n§6仅名称：§r\n使用服务器列表中的名称，例如 \"Minecraft Server\"。\n§6仅IP：§r\n\"192.168.1.40\"\n§6名称和IP：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40\"\n§6名称、IP和端口：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"\n§6名称、IP、端口和MC版本：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1\"\n\n§c§l注意：§r连接多人服务器期间修改可能引发异常。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging": "调试",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.rendererMode": "渲染器模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugRenderingColors": "调试渲染配色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode": "仅渲染LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode.@tooltip": "开启后，禁用大部分原版Minecraft渲染。\n\n注意：请勿在开启此模式时报告问题！\n此设置仅供娱乐和调试使用，不保证Mod兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe": "渲染线框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe.@tooltip": "开启后，以线框形式渲染LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings": "启用调试快捷键",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings.@tooltip": "开启后，可使用以下快捷键切换调试状态。\nF6：开启/关闭LOD渲染\nF7：开启/关闭仅渲染LOD\nF8：循环切换调试渲染模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld": "启用纯白世界",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld.@tooltip": "开启后，不传递顶点颜色。\n适用于调试着色器。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors": "显示重叠四边形错误",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors.@tooltip": "开启后，将重叠四边形显示为亮红色，便于识别。\n关闭后，正常渲染四边形。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection": "记录缓冲区垃圾回收",
