  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues": "允许不安全的界面输入值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues.@tooltip": "开启后，只对配置输入进行非常有限的验证。\n\n警告：可能导致不稳定或崩溃，请自行承担风险。\n注意：此选项不会跨会话保存。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe": "调试线框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering": "启用调试线框渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering.@tooltip": "开启后，绘制用于调试内部功能的各类线框。",
